# Canonical sJira shape (v26.10.8 campaign workgraph).
#
# Fold law: this graph declares NO graph-local work-item vocabulary. Every work
# item is an sj:WorkOrder in the canonical semantic-jira-pack shape
# (ggen_igniter's priv/ggen/semantic-jira-pack, prefix
# sj: <https://ggen-igniter.dev/ontology/semantic-jira#>), with
# sj:standing/sj:repository/sj:acceptance/sj:authorityCeiling/sj:evidenceCeiling.
# Epics/milestone groupings are prov:Activity, never sj:WorkOrder individuals.
#
# Scope disclaimer: this graph authors only work orders whose receipts exist on
# disk under docs/sjira/v26.10.8/ (or are explicitly marked
# coordinator-recorded). Every sj:standing value cites its receipt path via
# prov:wasDerivedFrom / rdfs:seeAlso. NO authority is granted by this graph;
# all orders carry sj:authorityCeiling "CONSTRUCT" — consequential DO flows
# only through a separately admitted BRCE path.
#
# Standing as of 2026-10-08 at the cited landing SHAs. Standing at another SHA
# is UNKNOWN; historical success at one subject is not exact-head evidence.

